WEBVTT

00:12:58.807 --> 00:13:03.283
pushed electricity into my spinal cord
to excite my nervous system,

00:13:03.307 --> 00:13:06.005
as I walked in my exo.

00:13:06.538 --> 00:13:08.839
And for the first time
since I was paralyzed,

00:13:08.863 --> 00:13:11.640
I could feel my legs underneath me.

00:13:12.347 --> 00:13:13.515
Not normally --

00:13:13.539 --> 00:13:15.426
(Applause)

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.693
Thank you.

00:13:16.718 --> 00:13:18.162
(Applause)

00:13:18.553 --> 00:13:21.752
It wasn't a normal feeling,
but with the stimulator turned on,

00:13:21.776 --> 00:13:25.522
upright in my exo,
my legs felt substantial.

00:13:25.546 --> 00:13:31.149
I could feel the meat of my muscles
on the bones of my legs,